"    ╭ Keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮    "
"    │ j / k, ↓ / ↑, wheel      Scroll one line                             │    "
"   m│ Ctrl-d / Ctrl-u          Half page down / up                         │   █"
"    │ Ctrl-f / Ctrl-b, Space   Page down / up                              │   █"
"  mi│ g / G                    Top / bottom                                │   █"
"    │ b / o                    Toggle the files / outline panel            │   █"
"  A │ f                        Focus mode: hide the panels, full width     │p  │"
"  do│ Tab / Shift-Tab          Cycle focus between the panes               │ed │"
"  co│ Tab then ← / →           Move focus in that direction                │   │"
"  (h│ l                        Focus the pane to the right                 │   │"
"    │ j / k in a panel         Move, Enter opens or returns                │   │"
"    │ Space, ← / → in a panel  Fold, collapse / expand a folder or section │   │"
"  In│ - / = in a panel         Fold all / unfold all                       │   │"
"  ──│ T in the files panel     Show titles instead of file names           │   │"
"    │ ] / [                    Select the next / previous link             │   │"
"  ▎ │ Enter, click             Follow the selected link                    │sh │"
"    │ H / L                    Back / forward through visited pages        │   │"
"    │ Ctrl-p                   Find a file in the folder                   │   │"
"  Us│ E                        Edit the file in $EDITOR, reload on return  │   │"
"  ──│ /                        Search, Enter to keep, Esc to cancel        │   │"
"    │ n / N                    Next / previous match                       │   │"
"    │ t                        Table of contents                           │    "
"    ╰─────────────────────────────────── j/k scroll · any other key closes ╯    "
" stdin   /table  1/4                                        ? help  q quit  Top "
